1
00:00:00,905 --> 00:00:02,935
(Penny:)I'm gonna need
more information.

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,110
(Sheldon:)Nothing odd.

3
00:00:04,108 --> 00:00:06,278
(Sheldon:)I just wanted
to rub Amy's nose in it.

4
00:00:07,545 --> 00:00:09,445
(Penny:)Okay, look, I might
be overreacting,

5
00:00:09,446 --> 00:00:11,546
(Penny:)but how am I supposed
to get past this

6
00:00:11,549 --> 00:00:13,519
(Penny:)when I know tomorrow
you're gonna go to work

7
00:00:13,517 --> 00:00:15,087
(Penny:)and see this woman?

8
00:00:15,085 --> 00:00:16,415
(Sheldon:)Forgive me for eavesdropping,

9
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,060
(Sheldon:)but as I see it,
there's a simple solution.

10
00:00:20,057 --> 00:00:22,927
(Leonard:)Wake up, wake up, wake up.

11
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,760
(Sheldon:)Bring Penny to meet Mandy.

12
00:00:28,766 --> 00:00:30,596
(Leonard:)What? Why?

13
00:00:30,601 --> 00:00:33,331
(Sheldon:)Well, right now, Penny's
imagination is running wild,

14
00:00:33,337 --> 00:00:35,207
(Sheldon:)but if they meet,
that will eliminate

15
00:00:35,206 --> 00:00:37,736
(Sheldon:)the mystery
and alleviate her fears.

16
00:00:37,741 --> 00:00:41,541
(Sheldon:)Like when that Sparkletts guy
let me look under his eye patch.

17
00:00:44,248 --> 00:00:47,948
(Leonard:)Uh, first of all,
you made that guy cry.

18
00:00:47,952 --> 00:00:51,122
(Sheldon:)And we learned that you don't
need an eyeball to do that.

19
00:00:53,991 --> 00:00:56,761
(Leonard:)Secondly, I can't think
of a more horrible idea

20
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,330
(Leonard:)than Penny meeting Mandy.

21
00:00:58,329 --> 00:01:00,399
(Penny:)Really? Why is that?

